"hero.thesis":"I read the business through data, decide with the brand at stake and build the product that makes the decision happen.",
"hero.sub":"Brand, growth and technology on the same table. In practice: I find the opportunity by reading consumer behaviour, build the business case, defend it with whoever decides, and stay with it until the result shows up in the numbers.",
"hero.cta1":"LinkedIn","hero.cta2":"See the cases","hero.cta3":"WhatsApp","hero.cta4":"Call",
