"np.t":"AI-assisted visual briefing",
"np.tag":"Creative reference platform for agency operations",
"np.p1":"The bottleneck shows up when creative direction reaches design as text only. The idea behind the post gets lost in translation, the asset comes back different from what was intended, and the revision cycle starts.",
"np.p2":"I'm building a platform where client service enters the creative direction and the strategic objective of the post, and the AI returns a pack of real references from the web to the creative team, with visual examples and direction adapted to that specific brief.",
"np.f":"<b>Input</b>: the creative direction and strategic objective of the post|<b>Output</b>: real visual references, with the rationale for why each one fits that brief|<b>Cuts the rework</b> caused by briefs that exist only as text|<b>Shortens the time</b> between an approved brief and a finished asset|<b>Raises throughput</b> for the client service and creative pair, without taking autonomy from the designer",
"np.for":"In development for the operation at Camila Marketing, Branding e Comunicação.",
